{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUMO.</strong> ON. YOUR. COUCH.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In FULL CONTACT, take control of an underground sumo wrestler to battle it out with your real-life friends. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW TO PLAY ONLINE:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online play is available through Steam Remote Play Together. In game, press Shift+Tab, click on your friend's profile, and select Remote Play Together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up and play with an <strong>accessible 3-button control scheme while you hype up the crowd</strong> and <strong>increase your hype meter</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785410/extras/7cd647473b02decef90d0ba4dd2d0089.poster.avif?t=1754418539\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785410/extras/7cd647473b02decef90d0ba4dd2d0089.webm?t=1754418539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER 4 UNIQUE CHARACTERS:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>RICKY C.</u></strong><u>: THE 11th GENERATION CHAMPION</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785410/extras/6c41b5c66d5fe73c968857b7977acbc7.avif?t=1754418539\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785410/extras_big/6c41b5c66d5fe73c968857b7977acbc7.webp?t=1754418539 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SLAM:</strong>\u00a0Standard, pushes enemies back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPECIAL:</strong> Quick Dash.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>8-BALL</u></strong><u>: FUNKY ROBO-DANCER</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785410/extras/de1d452f1a6b8bb1621b7dc4b9e9a075.avif?t=1754418539\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785410/extras_big/de1d452f1a6b8bb1621b7dc4b9e9a075.webp?t=1754418539 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SLAM:</strong>\u00a0Head spin, increases movement speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPECIAL:</strong>\u00a0Stylish Taunt. Builds hype when up close.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>BELO</u></strong><u>: BUSINESS BEAR</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785410/extras/54903f8f5351477ed6a2a605351c3ab8.avif?t=1754418539\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785410/extras_big/54903f8f5351477ed6a2a605351c3ab8.webp?t=1754418539 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SLAM:</strong>\u00a0Hold to charge up for a more powerful strike.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPECIAL:</strong>\u00a0Hold to gain armor.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>CARRIE</u></strong><u>: HAUNTED ROOKIE</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785410/extras/fa129249ee5fc9a147950d35132d2649.avif?t=1754418539\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785410/extras_big/fa129249ee5fc9a147950d35132d2649.webp?t=1754418539 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragr